<rml>
<head>
    <title>Modern settings</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="settings.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="backdrop" class="interactive" data-model="settings">
        <div id="settings" class="panel interactive">
            <div class="settings-header">
                <div class="text-title">Modern settings</div>
                <div class="text-muted">Optional improvements. Switch any of them off to play classic MU.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="section-title">Interface</div>
            <div class="setting" data-event-click="toggle('hd')">
                <div class="setting-text">
                    <div class="setting-name">HD interface</div>
                    <div class="setting-help">Modern HUD: status window, skill bar, menu dock and experience bar.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="switch" data-class-on="hd_interface"><div class="knob"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="setting" data-event-click="toggle('windows')">
                <div class="setting-text">
                    <div class="setting-name">Modern windows</div>
                    <div class="setting-help">Inventory with the modern look (needs the HD interface).</div>
                </div>
                <div class="switch" data-class-on="modern_windows"><div class="knob"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="setting" data-event-click="toggle('cursor')">
                <div class="setting-text">
                    <div class="setting-name">HD cursor</div>
                    <div class="setting-help">Sharp, modern mouse cursors.</div>
                    <div class="setting-note" data-if="cursor_restart">Restart the game to apply.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="switch" data-class-on="hd_cursor"><div class="knob"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="setting" data-event-click="toggle('skin')">
                <div class="setting-text">
                    <div class="setting-name">Modern skin</div>
                    <div class="setting-help">Modern frames and buttons for the classic windows and dialogs.</div>
                    <div class="setting-note" data-if="skin_restart">Restart the game to apply.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="switch" data-class-on="modern_skin"><div class="knob"></div></div>
            </div>

            <div class="section-title">Controls</div>
            <div class="setting" data-event-click="toggle('wasd')">
                <div class="setting-text">
                    <div class="setting-name">WASD movement</div>
                    <div class="setting-help">Walk with W, A, S and D. The W potion, master tree (A), commands (D) and personal shop (S) move to Shift + key.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="switch" data-class-on="wasd_movement"><div class="knob"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="setting" data-event-click="toggle('zoom')">
                <div class="setting-text">
                    <div class="setting-name">Mouse wheel zoom</div>
                    <div class="setting-help">Zoom the camera in and out with the wheel, further out than classic MU. Off: the classic F10 lock and range.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="switch" data-class-on="wheel_zoom"><div class="knob"></div></div>
            </div>

            <div class="section-title">Graphics</div>
            <div class="setting" data-event-click="toggle('textures')">
                <div class="setting-text">
                    <div class="setting-name">Enhanced textures</div>
                    <div class="setting-help">Mipmaps and anisotropic filtering: steadier, sharper ground and objects in the distance.</div>
                    <div class="setting-note" data-if="textures_restart">Restart the game to apply.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="switch" data-class-on="enhanced_textures"><div class="knob"></div></div>
            </div>

            <div class="section-title">Post-processing <span class="text-muted">(world only, the interface stays sharp)</span></div>
            <div class="setting" data-event-click="toggle('aa')">
                <div class="setting-text">
                    <div class="setting-name">Anti-aliasing (FXAA)</div>
                    <div class="setting-help">Smooths jagged edges of models and scenery.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="switch" data-class-on="anti_aliasing"><div class="knob"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="setting" data-event-click="toggle('sharpen')">
                <div class="setting-text">
                    <div class="setting-name">Sharpening</div>
                    <div class="setting-help">Brings back fine detail in textures.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="switch" data-class-on="sharpening"><div class="knob"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="setting" data-event-click="toggle('color')">
                <div class="setting-text">
                    <div class="setting-name">Color enhancement</div>
                    <div class="setting-help">Richer colours, a touch more contrast and a soft vignette.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="switch" data-class-on="color_enhance"><div class="knob"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="setting" data-event-click="toggle('bloom')">
                <div class="setting-text">
                    <div class="setting-name">Bloom</div>
                    <div class="setting-help">Wings, excellent items, fire and spells glow.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="switch" data-class-on="bloom"><div class="knob"></div></div>
            </div>

            <div class="settings-footer">
                <div class="button" data-event-click="close">Close</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
